message: "If you use or build on this software, please credit it as below."
title: "Claude Code Control Room"
abstract: "A web control room for running several Claude Code sessions in parallel: live terminals, per-session state from Claude Code hooks, a shared board with hierarchical locks (advisory, or enforced for file edits by a hook), per-project notes injected into every new session, and a per-session file history."
type: software
authors:
